flowchart LR
  A[选 Max 实例] --> B[OCR 健康检查]
  B --> C[打开自动蒙皮 UI]
  C --> D[收集模型/骨骼 handles]
  D --> E[准备列表 · 选定校验]
  E --> F{用户确认?}
  F -->|否| X([停止])
  F -->|是| G[开始蒙皮 · 等待完成]

  classDef step fill:#14532d,stroke:#86efac,color:#dcfce7
  classDef gate fill:#713f12,stroke:#fde68a,color:#fefce8
  classDef stop fill:#7f1d1d,stroke:#fca5a5,color:#fee2e2
  class A,B,C,D,E,G step
  class F gate
  class X stop
